        "value": "<p data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"479\"><strong data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"477\">Procedure Details:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"850\">\n<li data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"568\">\n<p data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"568\"><strong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"501\">Type of Stress:</strong> Treadmill (Bruce Protocol) / Dobutamine infusion (as applicable)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"649\">\n<p data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"649\"><strong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"615\">Duration of Exercise / Peak HR Achieved:</strong> __________ minutes / ______ bpm</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"702\">\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"702\"><strong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"691\">% of Age-Predicted Max HR Achieved:</strong> ______ %</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"780\">\n<p data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"780\"><strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"733\">Blood Pressure Response:</strong> Normal / Hypertensive / Hypotensive response</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"894\"><strong data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"892\">Echocardiographic Findings:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_sk2ct_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_sk2ct_13 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"1228\">\n<thead data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"945\">\n<tr data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"945\">\n<th data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"911\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Wall Segment</th>\n<th data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"918\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rest</th>\n<th data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"927\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stress</th>\n<th data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"945\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interpretation</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1228\">\n<tr data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1045\">\n<td data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1012\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Anterior wall</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1021\">Normal</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1030\">Normal</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1045\">No ischemia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1088\">\n<td data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1055\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Septum</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1064\">Normal</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1073\">Normal</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1088\">No ischemia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1138\">\n<td data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1105\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Inferior wall</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1114\">Normal</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1123\">Normal</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1138\">No ischemia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1187\">\n<td data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1154\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lateral wall</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1163\">Normal</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1172\">Normal</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1187\">No ischemia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1228\">\n<td data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1195\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Apex</td>\n<td data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1204\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Normal</td>\n<td data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Normal</td>\n<td data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1228\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No ischemia</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1352\"><strong data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1350\">Overall LV Function:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1507\">\n<li data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1410\">\n<p data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1410\"><strong data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1367\">At Rest:</strong> Normal LV systolic function (EF ~ ___%).</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1465\">\n<p data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1465\"><strong data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1427\">At Stress:</strong> EF increased appropriately to ___%.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1507\">\n<p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1507\">No inducible wall motion abnormality.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1551\"><strong data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1549\">ECG Findings During Stress:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1683\">\n<li data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1683\">\n<p data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1683\">No significant ST-T changes / No arrhythmia noted.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><strong data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1709\">Impression:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1910\">\n<li data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1759\">\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1759\">Adequate stress echocardiography performed.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1802\">\n<p data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1802\"><strong data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1800\">No evidence of inducible ischemia.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1871\">\n<p data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1871\">Normal LV systolic function with appropriate response to stress.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1910\">\n<p data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1910\">Negative stress echo for ischemia.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
